static.solution:
\rho=7, \theta=\frac{ \pi}{3}, and \phi=\frac{7 \pi}{4}. The relations between the spherical and rectangular coordinates imply
\begin{array}{rcl}
x \amp  = \amp  \rho \sin\phi \cos\theta = 7 \sin \frac{7 \pi}{4} \cos \frac{ \pi}{3} = 7 \cdot \frac{-\sqrt{2}}{2} \cdot \frac{1}{2} \\
y \amp  = \amp  \rho \sin\phi \sin\theta = 7 \sin \frac{7 \pi}{4} \sin \frac{ \pi}{3} = 7 \cdot \frac{-\sqrt{2}}{2} \cdot \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \\
z \amp  = \amp  \rho \cos\phi = 7 \cos \frac{7 \pi}{4}=7 \cdot \frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}
\end{array}
